      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice but it's not enough. if i just let it settle, i'm still here living in the middle of the mess. i'm still looking at their faces every day. wouldn't it be easier if i just... ended the story here? while i still have some dignity left, instead of watching myself slowly decay into someone nobody wants to know.",
